a","history":[{"commit":"0ab521ea","summary":"A25: click walk tools/walk/a25_notifications.py (both sizes 42/42: unavailable/off/on/pending/denied/error/dismissed rows, a finished turn while unfocused notifies once, the click opens its Session, focus acknowledges, a focused window never notifies), UX rows (7 states x 2 sizes, 9) + captures docs/ux/a25; scripts/apply-makepad-patches.sh + the tree-identity test; A3/A7 walks accept the honest Unavailable row"},{"commit":"8c49c441","summary":"wip(A25): attention — the web's tracker, desktop notifications and use-attention natively (OS behind NotifyOs; makepad API via cfg(makepad_notifications)), the Settings row's toggle/Enabling…/Unavailable/alert states, focus acknowledges, a notice click opens its Session"},{"commit":"7a9e7d21","summary":"wip(A25): makepad notification API patch — macOS UNUserNotificationCenter backend (post/close/authorization/click, Unavailable outside an .app bundle), Android NotificationManager + POST_NOTIFICATIONS through the same API, Cx::focused_window"},{"commit":"b1fe23fb","summary":"secrets in captures, enforced in code: repo_hermetic fails any tracked snap whose secret-like field (token / api key / credential / secret / password) carries a typed value; tools/walk/snapsafe.py scrubs them in the shared savers (a10_lib, judge tour, walk runner); four dummy credentials blanked"},{"commit":"00ba086c","summary":"docs(final-live): temp paths in the walk logs read <tmp> (repo_hermetic: <TMP>"},{"commit":"ffc46c7d","summary":"docs(final-live): the supervisor's final-build live proofs — server SIGTERM 50/50 and SIGKILL 50/50 with real turns, app restart mid-history 18/18 (every earlier turn back, the next prompt streams); a12 walk and live smoke checks updated for server-titled Sessions"},{"commit":"5da3784c","summary":"parity: onboarding rows 93/94/95/97/98 C->A on the LIVE fresh-serve proof (supervisor's bar) — A 294 / B 43 / C 24"},{"commit":"24f6aba2","summary":"docs(onboarding): LIVE proof on a fresh octos serve — first launch -> onboarding panel (no_profile) -> MiniMax-M3 tested + saved -> coding Session -> the next prompt streams (11/11); key masked, scrubbed from the trace, absent from every file the run wrote; tools/judge/live_onboarding.py aborts before any key unless every selection landed"},{"commit":"26440b33","summary":"parity matrix regenerated after the A19 follow-up"},{"commit":"2193f089","summary":"Merge A19 follow-up: the first launch after the upgrade shows the full history — the migration carries the Session's folder and profile into the first open (a profile-less id only resolves through the connection's X-Profile-Id); an 'unknown session' hydrate is retried once (re-dial carrying the profile); 'Loading conversation…' instead of an empty timeline, 'Session recovery required' on failure"},{"commit":"e9f98f7f","summary":"docs(A19b): live + replay evidence — the first launch after the upgrade reopens dsflash:main in its folder with its WHOLE history (scroll-read to the top, desktop + phone) and the next prompt streams; the relaunch restores it; a profile-less id opened from the sidebar on a fresh connection is re-dialed carrying its profile and shows its history (both sizes); 'Loading conversation…' and 'Session recovery required' by /snap numbers (both sizes); the fresh-server onboarding re-run; ux-scores: the merged migration's first launch re-scored 3 as the BEFORE, the A19b rows added"},{"commit":"37a799b1","summary":"fix(A19b): the recovery hint reads a reason once — a reason that ends its own sentence is not doubled ('..'), and the wait's own reason is short ('the server did not answer in time')"}],"repo_root":"<PATH>","status":[{"code":"??","detail":"untracked","path":"docs/ux/a25/live-macos/"},{"code":"??","detail":"untracked","path":"tools/walk/a25_live_macos.py"},{"code":"??","detail":"untracked","path":"tools/walk/a25_nc.swift"}]},"session_id":"dsflash:main","workspace":{"contract":["api octos-app-ui/v1alpha1","source session/open